/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 220 0 R
/E (IIT Kanpur boasts world-class infrastructure facilities. The department has been endowed with enviable computational facilities. In addition, the department is equipped with the latest tools and systems used in the industries for the students to obtain hands-on experience. Having some of the most complicated software, like product life cycle management, simulation, statistical analysis, financial modeling, process design, and control, etc., in the well-equipped laboratories allow the students to learn the vital skills enabling them to succeed in the future; both in industry and academia.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
